text:
The problem of the Christmas tree
Should very easy be.
Here are a few suggestions. and
They're offered to you free;
The carpenter a plane tree likes.
The dentist favors gums;
The sugar man a maple Graves,
The politicians, plums.
The oil man sticks to olives, and
The lovers love the pine;
The swimmers gather at the beech;
For pets, the dogwood's fine.
For doctors. try the sycamore;
For dudes. the spruce should do;
One hardly thinks the office man
Likes lemons now, would you?
Tobacconists the smoke tree boast
The winter bellies like FIR;
Bad jokers take the chestnut. but
It's orange tree for Herl


